Grafana dashboards
==================

Aviso NATS / JetStream dashboard (dashboards/nats-jetstream.json)
Copyright 2017-2023 The NATS Authors
Apache License 2.0; see LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.
Adapted from the prometheus-nats-exporter JetStream dashboard:
https://github.com/nats-io/prometheus-nats-exporter/blob/main/walkthrough/grafana-jetstream-dash-helm.json
Modified by ECMWF to replace the ${DS__NATS-PROMETHEUS} __inputs datasource
constant with a standard datasource template variable bound to every panel and
target, to add a namespace template variable scoping all queries, to remove the
JetStream memory panels that are dead in a file-storage deployment, and to add
a Resources & Storage row sourced from kube-state-metrics, cAdvisor and kubelet
volume stats.
